OL,3,AAsda hires ex-Morrisons boss in bid to
OL,4,Agrow firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsda has appointed a former Morrisons
OL,7,Fboss as chief executive to help lead
OL,8,Frevival efforts at the supermarket
OL,9,Fchain.
OL,11,FAsda, which is based in Leeds, said
OL,12,FDavid Potts would take on the role with
OL,13,Fimmediate effect, while current boss
OL,14,FAllan Leighton would become
OL,15,Fnon-executive chairman, two years after
OL,16,Freturning to lead the supermarket
OL,17,Fchain.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
