OL,3,AAsda hires ex-Morrisons boss in bid to
OL,4,Agrow firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FPotts led Morrisons from its Bradford
OL,7,Fheadquarters for eight years until
OL,8,F2023, overseeing a turnaround during
OL,9,Fwhich the supermarket chain was bought
OL,10,Fby US private equity firm Clayton,
OL,11,FDubilier & Rice.
OL,13,FPotts said Asda had "made good progress
OL,14,Fbut significant opportunities remain"
OL,15,Fto reinvigorate sales, with a focus on
OL,16,Fkeeping prices low for shoppers.
